00:15:56.330 --> 00:16:01.530
If you notice, there's no cutaways, because when Rain held the baby, the baby actually stopped crying instantly.
如果你们注意看，会发现没有剪辑，因为当雷恩抱起宝宝时，宝宝真的瞬间就不哭了。

324
00:16:02.150 --> 00:16:03.850
It was really amazing.
这真的很神奇。

325
00:16:04.130 --> 00:16:07.810
And if you watch Oscar's reaction, it's really earneSt.
而且如果你看奥斯卡的反应，那是发自内心的。

326
00:16:08.010 --> 00:16:09.050
He's like, wow, I'm impressed.
他就像是，哇，我被惊艳到了。

327
00:16:09.050 --> 00:16:10.550
Rain is the baby whisperer.
雷恩简直是“宝宝安抚大师”。

328
00:16:10.790 --> 00:16:17.050
Well, this was a callback to the Viewing Party episode in season 7, when Dwight is the only one who can calm Cece.
这其实呼应了第七季《观看派对》那一集，当时只有德怀特能安抚西西。

